    <unit id="39" name="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Select a time or a time range from a popup time panel.</source>
        <target state="translated">從彈出時間面板中選擇單個時間或時間範圍。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="40" name="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>TimePicker supports 12-hour and 24-hour clocks, size variants, disabled states, stepped minute and second options, visual variants, validation status, and range selection.</source>
        <target state="translated">TimePicker 支援 12 小時和 24 小時制、尺寸變體、禁用狀態、分鐘和秒的步進選項、視覺變體、校驗狀態以及範圍選擇。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
